WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Sunday, September 17th, it is not a gathering, it is not a party initiative,

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
it is a gathering of thousands of people from all over Italy who want to build, plan and conceive the future.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
We are planning to continue with this government for the years to come, but we must change Europe.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
This year in Pontida, there will be women and men from the League of Italy and other countries.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
It will be a day of friendship, of politics, of the future.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.000
There will be thousands of young people who, the day before, will meet all over Italy

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:43.000
to discuss school, university, work, the environment, culture.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.000
And then it will be the beginning of a big race where the League will be the protagonist.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.000
We will write together a page of history, beautiful politics and life in presence.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.000
I am waiting for you.
